#
# README
#

You can put in this directory any document concerning the application module 
or the equipment(s) controlled by the application. The prefered format for the 
documents are PDF (.pdf) and text (.txt).

At least you must provide a document describing:
- the macros used in the database templates,
- the initializations that must be done,
- the sequencer programs and their parameters
